body:
Just change from Samsung to iPhone and very disappointed that you can&#39;t add photos to a event.
Nice &amp; clean interface but it&#39;s soo much easier to see an attached photos with info on it in the event vs having to type all info to note section. 
i.e. Kids party invites with rsvp and party details;
Follow up on bills or quotation received;
Specific things to buy or bring to event, a photo of the item with brand, size, type, how it looks so you can find it easier in store.
